      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the Fei Hou mountain monkey checkpoint, caravan groups wrestle the monkey king in an agreed order so their wagons can pass with fewer losses. After Jia Long’s group moves through, Lin clan’s vice leader calls the next turn and sends Lin Dong out.",
